structure 

    we have fixed size array for chaced pages
        when we want to chace a new page we iterate throu it and see if it is chaced if yes 
            we return index to the array of chached pages
            
            if it is not there we look for empty space if there is no empty space we go and search 
                for chaced place which least amount of derefs
            
                the one that leaves will be flushed to the disc

    
        for each deref we check if the index and files are the same as the one that is being chached
            if it is not ther we loop thoru the array and fetch it from the disc

